<% content_for :title, "About" %>

<section class="bg-ink py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-4 text-5xl font-light text-ground md:text-6xl">Built for people who care where they live.</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-ground/65">TT Realty connects discerning buyers and renters with verified listings and advisors who know every street, school district, and negotiation lever that matters.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
  <div class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
    <p>We started as a boutique advisory desk for luxury residential deals — and grew into a platform that still treats every search like a private placement.</p>
    <p>Every listing is verified by an on-market specialist. Every inquiry is routed to a human advisor. And every search experience is designed to feel quieter, clearer, and more considered than the usual marketplace noise.</p>
    <p><%= link_to "Meet our agents →", agents_path, class: "font-medium text-ink underline decoration-trinidad underline-offset-4" %> or <%= link_to "get in touch", contact_path, class: "font-medium text-ink underline decoration-trinidad underline-offset-4" %> to list a property.</p>
  </div>
</section>
